{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "nlcd-raw",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "USGS Annual National Land Cover Database Collection 1.1 data bundles as downloaded by `_shared/scripts/download_raw.sh nlcd` from mrlc.gov: land cover (LndCov) and fractional impervious surface (FctImp), one zip per product and year, 1985-2024. Each zip holds one CONUS GeoTIFF (uint8, 30 m, 160000 x 105000, Albers Equal Area on WGS 84, nodata 250) and its FGDC metadata. The other four Annual NLCD products (land cover change, land cover confidence, impervious descriptor, spectral change day of year) follow the same URL pattern and are not mirrored. Read-only.",
